                    margin, and wrote “Monday Oct 6.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d136-f4" n="4" xml:id="d136-f4-content">
                <p>An unknown hand crossed out “Tuesday’s” and wrote “Monday’s” above it.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d136-f5" n="5" xml:id="d136-f5-content">
                <p>Poindexter approved the
                    recommendation.</p>
            </note>
